# pPlay interface language file (utf-8).
#   key = translation       (the key is the english text shown by pPlay)
#   @name = language name   (shown in Settings > Language)
# Escapes: \n (new line), \t, \\, \= . Lines starting with # are comments.
# Put your own files (or fixed copies) in the pPlay data directory, "lang" folder:
# they are listed in Settings > Language and override the bundled ones.
# This file lists every key: copy it to start a new language.

